{
  "ruleId": "DED-AGNIVEER-OWN",
  "_note": "The Agniveer's own subscription: \"An assessee, being an individual who has enrolled in the Agnipath Scheme and subscribes to the Agniveer Corpus Fund on or after the 1st November, 2022, shall be allowed a deduction in the computation of his total income, of the whole of the amount paid or deposited in his account in the said Fund during the tax year\" (s.125(1), p.161) — the whole amount, base AMOUNT_PAID; enrolment and the date are entry conditions. Old regime only: s.202(2)(a)(xii) keeps s.125(2), not (1) (p.227). TY 2026-27 only; the 1961 counterpart, s.80CCH, is unread (W-075d). rulebook DED-AGNIVEER-001. D-140.",
